        "title": "Party update",
        "summary": "The party's current state.",
        "description": "Sent to every member whenever the party changes: someone joins or leaves, leadership changes, or the party starts or stops searching. Render from the full state rather than patching. `status` is `LOBBY`, `STARTING` (a ping-based party is measuring its members' latency; the `gameMode` is included) or `SEARCHING`. Once a party's search produces a match the party returns to `LOBBY`, so the same group can queue again; the players' `MATCH_FOUND` arrives separately.",
